<i>Well, that's all! So long!</i>

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.300
<i>I got it all wrong.</i>

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:59.220
<i>This wasn't a real date at all.</i>

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.720
<i>It's no wonder she hasn't come back.</i>

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.760
<i>Please forgive me, Desumi-san!</i>

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:18.660
<i>Next time...</i>

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.320
<i>I promise to create a date 
plan that you'll enjoy!</i>

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.090
<i>So, please...</i>

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:34.410
<i>Please, give me one more chance!</i>

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.900
Desumi-san...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:16:59.530
<b>freeze</b>

00:16:59.240 --> 00:16:59.550
<b>shiver</b>

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.200
What are you doing, Fudo?

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.700
Desumi-san!

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:06.440
You came back?!

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.700
I went to buy drinks,

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:13.000
but the store was crowded, 
so I got stuck there a while.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:18.650
You know how...

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:21.970
these things make your mouth dry
unless you have something to drink?

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.390
I eat them sometimes myself, so I know.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.900
Now, what were you saying 
about the strongest insect?

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:30.550
Impossible...

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.110
What's impossible?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.690
Are you saying... you were 
actually enjoying this date?

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:38.240
What's with you, Fudo?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.490
You've been acting a little 
weird for a while now.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.430
W-Well... see...

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.730
Y-You aren't angry, Desumi-san?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.430
Of course I'm not!

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:54.830
But it's nice to know that you 
worry about these things, too.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.230
Well, sure...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:02.510
I'm just happy knowing you made 
up that whole plan for me.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.490
I'm content just being out with you.

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.620
The world might think 
it's weird, but who cares?

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.520
We are who we are.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.740
Let's go easy on ourselves, Fudo.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.210
<i>This is...</i>

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:30.460
<i>Just like it was that day.</i>

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:35.830
Fudo?

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:50.900
<i>What is this...</i>

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.330
<i>this all-new feeling?!</i>

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.580
I-It's a call!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.240
Y-Y-Yeah, looks like it!

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:08.750
Well, I should be going.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.840
Y-Yeah...

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.250
See you later!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.260
Wretched heroes...

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.550
I'm here for payback!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.800
Too bad you'll just get more of the same!

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.220
Let's go!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:28.870
Hey, Red!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.170
We're fighting, here!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:34.290
<b>bliss</b>

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:31.750
Come on, man!

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:34.290
What's wrong with you, Reaper Princess?!

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.740
<b>This is the Gekko
women's dorm
 (pets allowed)</b>

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.740
<i>This is the Gekko women's dorm.</i>

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:17.750
<i>Many of the female staffers who work 
for Secret Society Gekko live here.</i>

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.750
<i>My name is Hellko.</i>

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.970
Were you a good girl while I was gone?!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:24.030
<b><i>hugs</i></b>

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:27.260
<i>I am the precious little kitty of 
Reaper Princess, A.K.A. Desumi Magahara.</i>

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:33.020
<i>I'm told that there are many who tremble 
at the sound of my mistress's name,</i>

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:36.110
<i>but I find that hard to believe.</i>

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>When she's at home...</i>

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.520
Is this a good color on me?

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:43.860
<i>...she just seems like any other girl.</i>

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:47.610
<i>She's sensitive, awkward, and 
inclined toward loneliness.</i>

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:52.120
<i>Just your average everyday girl.</i>

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:56.250
What do you think it's like to be in love?

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:59.350
I guess I'll never know...

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:09.760
At work, they started a rumor that 
my favorite food is raw bear meat.

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:13.220
How could someone like me ever know love?

00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:15.310
<i>Then, one night...</i>

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:20.020
<i>My mistress came back in a daze.</i>

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:18.660
<b>sway</b>

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:20.370
<b>sway</b>

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:23.690
<i>I was terribly worried about her.</i>

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:25.780
<i>But...</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.550
<i>Ever since then, she's been 
laughing and smiling so much.</i>

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:32.710
<i>It's as if she's under a magic spell!</i>

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:35.920
Today they told me I was 
the incarnation of an ogre!

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.790
Isn't that a silly thing to say?

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:40.110
<i>A single match can start a fire!</i>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:43.290
<b>Red Saves the Day!!</b>

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:45.800
Which should I go with?

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:48.550
<i>She does appear happy.</i>

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:50.620
Well, you watch the house!

00:22:50.940 --> 00:22:54.310
<i>And she somehow seems prettier than before.</i>

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:55.720
See you later!

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:00.470
<i>What could have happened to her?</i>

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:05.070
<i>Just kidding.</i>

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:07.690
<i>I know exactly what it is.</i>

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:11.570
<i>Listen to me, you goon of a man...</i>

00:23:11.980 --> 00:23:15.080
<i>If you ever do anything 
to make my mistress sad,</i>

00:23:15.340 --> 00:23:17.140
<i>I'll see that you pay.</i>

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!</i>

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.910
<i>Fudo is going to infiltrate 
Gekko's fortress?!</i>

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:28.670
<i>We head to the amusement 
park after Fudo-senpai...</i>

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:29.550
<i>But there, we see...</i>

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:31.550
Pathetic humans!

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.350
I'll teach you the true meaning of fear!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 3     At Last, the Amusement Park

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:34.350
<b>smack</b>

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:37.390
<i>Love After World Domination, Episode 3:</i>

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.180
<i>"At Last, the Amusement Park"!</i>
